  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Weapon Modification (requires firearm with strength requirement)</strong></p><p>The weapon's firing power has been increased, allowing its targets to be blown backward by the velocity of the projectile. When you make a ranged weapon attack with this weapon against a creature that is within 30 feet of you, it deals an extra 1d6 damage, and you may up to 5 feet away from you if it is Large or smaller.</p><p>This extra power increases the recoil of the weapon and makes it more difficult to handle. The Strength requirement of the weapon is increased by 2.</p>",
